name:           mu
version:        0.1.0.0
synopsis:       Personal music downloader & player
description:    Please see the README on GitHub at <https://github.com/Futarimiti/mu#readme>
category:       Sound
homepage:       https://github.com/Futarimiti/mu#readme
bug-reports:    https://github.com/Futarimiti/mu/issues
author:         Carman Fu
maintainer:     futarimiti@163.com
copyright:      Carman Fu 2024
license:        MIT
license-file:   LICENSE
build-type:     Simple
extra-source-files:
